      "writtenOn": "2019-02-14T17:00:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we shouldn\u0027t do this automatically (here and in set_polarity).\n\nWe rely on the tcpc_discharge_vbus method instead. If any customization is needed there, then we can hook in there.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 209,
